	)
	(text "MCP23S08: SPI mode 0 slave on the main bus (CS GPIO8). SO releases within 100 ns of CS rising (datasheet Fig. 2-6, parameter 14), so it shares SPI_MISO without a buffer. A1/A0 low: opcodes 0x40 / 0x41."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 15 0)
		(effects
